{"video":"6G3L94NXGc4","lines":[{"t":[0,1.3],"en":"-Hello."},{"t":[1.3,2.6],"en":"-Ah, ding, ding, ding, ding, ding."},{"t":[2.6,3.6],"en":"Our first arrival."},{"t":[3.6,5.2],"en":"Welcome to Scranton."},{"t":[5.2,8],"en":"This is Hannah Smoltridge Barr."},{"t":[8,9.6],"en":"-Hannah Smoltridge Barr."},{"t":[9.6,12.1],"en":"-Welcome to our humble abode."},{"t":[12.1,14.5],"en":"Follow me to your desk."},{"t":[14.5,18.6],"en":"Your ball and chain is right over here."},{"t":[18.6,19.7],"en":"You know, a lot of these people,"},{"t":[19.7,21.6],"en":"this is the only family they have."},{"t":[21.6,27.8],"en":"So, as far as I'm concerned, this says, \"World's Best Dad.\""},{"t":[27.8,30.2],"en":"-Ah, there he is."},{"t":[30.2,31.8],"en":"Tony -- What's your last name?"},{"t":[31.8,33.5],"en":"-Gardner. -Gardner."},{"t":[33.5,35.1],"en":"I knew that. There you go."},{"t":[35.1,38],"en":"Gift bag for you, okay."},{"t":[38,40.5],"en":"-Thanks, Michael. I didn't get a gift bag."},{"t":[40.5,41.7],"en":"-Well, they're just for guests."},{"t":[41.7,43.4],"en":"If there are any left over, you can buy one later."},{"t":[43.4,44.9],"en":"-My bag's mostly pencils."},{"t":[44.9,48.8],"en":"-Ooh, and coupons to various hot spots around Scranton."},{"t":[48.8,52.4],"en":"All right, let me show you to your area, sir."},{"t":[52.4,53.6],"en":"Come on, big guy."},{"t":[53.6,56.2],"en":"-Can I have your pencils? -No."},{"t":[56.2,57.4],"en":"-Hi. -Hi."},{"t":[57.4,58.8],"en":"-I'm Pam. -Karen."},{"t":[58.8,60.1],"en":"I love your sweater."},{"t":[60.1,62.4],"en":"-Oh, thanks. My mom made it for me."},{"t":[62.4,63.7],"en":"-Really? That's so cool."},{"t":[63.7,64.8],"en":"I've always wanted to learn --"},{"t":[64.8,68.4],"en":"-Welcome, welcome, welcome!"},{"t":[68.4,70.6],"en":"Take me to your leader."},{"t":[70.6,75.4],"en":"Oh, wait, I am your leader."},{"t":[75.4,78.7],"en":"-Wait, are you a robot or a Martian?"},{"t":[78.7,81],"en":"-Mm, nah."},{"t":[81,83.5],"en":"I am actually your boss, Michael Scott."},{"t":[83.5,85.6],"en":"Welcome. Wow, you are very exotic-looking."},{"t":[85.6,87],"en":"Was your dad a GI, or..."},{"t":[98.5,101],"en":"-I'll be the number two guy here in Scranton in six weeks."},{"t":[101,101.7],"en":"How?"},{"t":[101.7,104],"en":"Name repetition, personality mirroring,"},{"t":[104,106],"en":"and never breaking off a handshake."},{"t":[106,108.5],"en":"I'm always thinking one step ahead,"},{"t":[108.5,113.7],"en":"like a carpenter that makes stairs."},{"t":[113.7,116.7],"en":"Hello."},{"t":[116.7,120],"en":"-Ah, you must be Andy Bernard."},{"t":[120,122.7],"en":"Aloha and welcome."},{"t":[122.7,124.3],"en":"And you must be Michael Scott."},{"t":[124.3,127.6],"en":"Aloha and hello."},{"t":[127.6,129.2],"en":"-Oh, very good."},{"t":[129.2,132.8],"en":"Welcome to our little kingdom."},{"t":[132.8,136.5],"en":"Uh, we have a bag of nifty gifties for you."},{"t":[136.5,139.1],"en":"-Michael, thank you for welcoming me"},{"t":[139.1,141.1],"en":"to your little kingdom, Mike."},{"t":[141.1,142.7],"en":"-Oh."},{"t":[142.7,143.8],"en":"-Nifty!"},{"t":[143.8,145.5],"en":"-They are nifty."},{"t":[145.5,147.4],"en":"They're nifty gifties."},{"t":[147.4,148.7],"en":"-You know who I really like?"},{"t":[148.7,150.1],"en":"It's this guy Andy Bernard."},{"t":[150.1,153.3],"en":"He has got this very likable way about him."},{"t":[155.4,158.3],"en":"-Which is why they need a passing game, right?"},{"t":[158.3,159.3],"en":"-No way."},{"t":[159.3,160.4],"en":"Get him out of here."},{"t":[160.4,162.1],"en":"We don't want any of this kind in here."},{"t":[162.1,163.1],"en":"Good to see you, man."},{"t":[163.1,163.6],"en":"-Oh, okay."},{"t":[163.6,164.2],"en":"-How are you?"},{"t":[164.2,166.1],"en":"Martin Nash, I presume?"},{"t":[166.1,168.9],"en":"This is a little gift bag for you, free of charge."},{"t":[168.9,169.5],"en":"Follow me."},{"t":[169.5,171.3],"en":"I will show you where all the slaves work."},{"t":[171.3,172.2],"en":"Not --"},{"t":[172.2,174.9],"en":"So, your desk is --"},{"t":[174.9,175.9],"en":"-Hi, I'm Jim."},{"t":[175.9,176.8],"en":"I'm new here. -Oh, my God."},{"t":[176.8,179.2],"en":"It's really you."},{"t":[179.2,180.7],"en":"-I was just doing a little joke there"},{"t":[180.7,181.7],"en":"about how we never met."},{"t":[181.7,183.2],"en":"-I know. I don't care."},{"t":[183.2,184.4],"en":"-Awesome."},{"t":[184.4,186.2],"en":"It's good to be back."},{"t":[186.2,187.4],"en":"The place looks really good."},{"t":[187.4,188.6],"en":"-It's really good to see you."},{"t":[188.6,190],"en":"-You, too."},{"t":[190,192.9],"en":"Where do I stand with Pam?"},{"t":[192.9,195.4],"en":"Um, no idea."},{"t":[195.4,197.5],"en":"I mean, we're friends."},{"t":[197.5,198.7],"en":"Always have been friends."},{"t":[198.7,202],"en":"Um, that is where we stand."},{"t":[202,203.9],"en":"-Well, well, well."},{"t":[203.9,206.6],"en":"Look what the cat dragged in from Stamford."},{"t":[206.6,207.9],"en":"-Hey, Dwight."},{"t":[207.9,209.3],"en":"-Fact."},{"t":[209.3,211.7],"en":"I am older. I am wiser."},{"t":[211.7,212.8],"en":"Do not mess with me."},{"t":[212.8,215.1],"en":"-Okay. Sounds good."},{"t":[215.1,216.2],"en":"-What are you doing?"},{"t":[216.2,217.4],"en":"-I don't know what you're talking about."},{"t":[217.4,218.4],"en":"-Do I have a spider on my forehead?"},{"t":[218.4,220.7],"en":"-No. Well, good."},{"t":[220.7,221.7],"en":"-Why are you looking at my forehead?"},{"t":[221.7,224.1],"en":"-I'm not."},{"t":[224.1,225.3],"en":"-Meet my eyeline, Jim."},{"t":[225.3,226.6],"en":"-I am."},{"t":[226.6,228.4],"en":"-Stop acting like an idiot."},{"t":[228.4,230.3],"en":"-Okay."},{"t":[230.3,232],"en":"-Hey, buddy."},{"t":[232,232.7],"en":"Welcome back."},{"t":[232.7,233.6],"en":"-Hey. How are you, man?"},{"t":[233.6,234],"en":"Good to see you."},{"t":[234,234.6],"en":"-Good to see you."},{"t":[234.6,236.1],"en":"-Good. How are you?"},{"t":[238.6,240.6],"en":"-So..."},{"t":[240.6,242.8],"en":"-Oh, I'm sorry. Are you sitting here now?"},{"t":[242.8,244.1],"en":"-Yeah."},{"t":[244.1,245.1],"en":"-Oh."},{"t":[247.3,250.6],"en":"-Um, unless you really, really want to pack."},{"t":[252.6,253.9],"en":"-You know, man, it's really your call."},{"t":[253.9,255.4],"en":"-Cool. Thank you."},{"t":[261.7,262.7],"en":"-You got it."},{"t":[262.7,268.3],"en":"-This one taken?"},{"t":[268.3,268.8],"en":"-No."},{"t":[268.8,269.3],"en":"-Good."},{"t":[271.9,273.3],"en":"-Yeah, Jim is a nice guy."},{"t":[274.4,275.8],"en":"That's why I got the desk."},{"t":[275.8,276.7],"en":"♪"},{"t":[292.4,293.5],"en":"♪"},{"t":[293.5,294.7],"en":"♪"},{"t":[294.7,295.7],"en":"♪"},{"t":[295.7,296.7],"en":"♪"},{"t":[296.7,297.7],"en":"♪"}]}
